OL,5,
OL,6,FCleveland Police's Chief Constable
OL,7,FVictoria Fuller says the "tragic
OL,8,Fincident will be felt across Cleveland"
OL,10,FImages show a large emergency services
OL,11,Fresponse at the scene - North East
OL,12,FAmbulance Service says it sent "14
OL,13,Fambulance resources"
